       EC_2 ARCH_2 |- forUpdateStatementListIR : EC_3 ARCH_3 EXIT

rule ForThreeClauseStmt_eval/cond-true-loop-cont-update-cont:
  EC_0 ARCH_0
    |- typedExpressionIR statementIR forUpdateStatementListIR
    : EC_4 ARCH_4 statementResult
